    "title": "Vegas Keno by Pokerist",
    "description": "<b>Welcome to the best online Keno game from Pokerist!</b>\r\nDownload the game and play for free!\r\nDiscover classic Keno gameplay or try out the new modes with amazing graphics!\r\nTry your luck and and have Vegas-style fun!\r\nGet free games in Cleopatra Keno or multiply your winnings in Wild Buffalo Keno!\r\n\r\n<b><u>Game features:</u></b>\r\n<b>\u2022 FREE CHIPS</b> \u2013 Play the game every day to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 REAL CASINO EXPERIENCE</b> \u2013 Immerse yourself in the world of online Keno from Pokerist and enjoy fantastic, authentic graphics!\r\n<b>\u2022 PICK YOUR GAME</b> \u2013 Play the most popular varieties:\r\n- CLASSIC VEGAS KENO: Choose 4\u201310 numbers on the field, then find out how many of your numbers match the 20 balls drawn from the lottery drum. The more hits you get, the higher your winnings!\r\n- CLEOPATRA KENO: The last of the 20 balls on the field is a Scarab. If you're lucky enough to catch it, you'll get free games!\r\n- WILD BUFFALO KENO: Each round, 6 BUFFALO icons will randomly show up on the field. The more BUFFALO icons you have in your cells, the higher your winnings multiplier!\r\n<b>\u2022 HOT/COLD</b> \u2013 See which numbers came up the most and least often for each online Keno machine! Track statistics and try your luck!\r\n<b>\u2022 QUESTS</b> \u2013 Complete daily quests to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 NO REGISTRATION</b>\u00a0\u2013 Get straight into the action. Choose guest mode to use our free casino app without registering.\r\n<b>\u2022 FAIR PLAY GUARANTEED</b> \u2013 Our certified Random Number Generator (RNG) gives you the best and fairest online Keno experience.\r\n<b>\u2022 YOUR OWN PROFILE PAGE</b>\u00a0\u2013 Track your current status and progress in the game! Get experience and level up. See how many games you've played and achievements you've completed. Get unique properties and display them on your profile. View other players' profiles to see how you compare!\r\n\r\n<b><u>Want more than Vegas Keno by Pokerist?</u></b>\r\nTry our other games for an unforgettable 3D experience:\r\n<b>\u2022 TEXAS HOLD'EM POKER</b>\u00a0\u2013 The most popular casino game among professional gamblers! Test your skills in amazing poker tournaments!\r\n<b>\u2022 BLACKJACK</b> \u2013 A simple game of \u201c21\u201d. An exciting 3D game that any blackjack fan is sure to enjoy.\r\n<b>\u2022 ROULETTE</b>\u00a0\u2013 Featuring stunning 3D graphics and three table varieties: French, American, and European.\r\n<b>\u2022 VIDEO POKER</b> \u2013 Classic casino video poker! Over 50 different video poker machines with fantastic graphics!\r\n<b>\u2022 SLOTS</b> \u2013 Explore our themed slots with lots of unique features!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to the official Facebook page of the game and be the first to find out about our promotions and news!\r\nhttps://facebook.com/Pokerist\r\nFollow us on Twitter and get free chips!\r\nhttps://twitter.com/KamaCasino\r\nVegas Keno by Pokerist is intended for those 21 and older for entertainment purposes only and does not offer real-money gambling or an opportunity to win real money or real prizes. Success in playing this game does not imply your success in a similar real-money casino game.\r\n \r\nVegas Keno by Pokerist does not require payment to download and play, but it does allow you to purchase virtual items with real money in the game. The app may also contain advertising.\r\n \r\nTerms of Service: https://wisewaveltd.com/terms-of-use\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wisewaveltd.com/privacy-policy\r\n \r\nPublished by Wise Wave Corporation Limited\r\nUnit A6, 12/F HUNG FUK FTY BLDG, 60 Hung To Road, Kwun Tong, Hong Kong",
